* Central Engine: Tuned Brass-Jingle Tambourine (played continuously as lead polyrhythmic driver), Twin Clean Electric Guitars (Fender Stratocaster / Telecaster through Twin Reverb amps).
* Orchestral Rig: 30-piece Symphonic Section (violins, cellos, French horns, timpani, orchestral harp).
* Rhythm & Electric: Fuzz Bass (Maestro FZ-1A overdrive), Agogô bells, Talking Drums, Surdo, Congas.
* Keys & Horns: Vox Continental organ, Grand Piano, Alto/Tenor Saxophones, Mariachi-style dual trumpets.

